Package: convmoment
Type: Package
Title: Generalized Binomial Moment Transformations Across Arbitrary Origins
Version: 0.2.3
Authors@R: person(given = c("Abdullah", "Al"),
                    family = "Mahmud",
                    role = c("aut", "cre"),
                    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2814-8798"),
                    email = "almahmud.sbi@gmail.com")
Description: Implements the generalized binomial framework for transforming
    statistical moments of any order across arbitrary origins.
    Provides a unified method for raw-to-raw, raw-to-central, and central-to-raw
    moment conversions using a single origin-shift parameter b = a - k and the
    symbolic binomial operator (a + b)^r with a^j -> mu'_j(a). Includes
    functions for moment transformation, direct moment computation from data,
    and validation against theoretical distributions (Binomial, Normal).
